CYN真悟当即吩咐僧人将客堂中的三人带来此处。NOR]]}},{type="addobject",args={"role01007"}},{type="addobject",args={"role01008"}},{type="addobject",args={"role01005"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}},{type="refresh",args={}}},caozuoName2="交谈",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"YEL真悟：你们昨天进寺，师傅当晚就毙命在此，这件事一定和你二人有关。少侠昨夜我派人在你房外看护，这足以证明大师的死不是你干的，还请劳烦少侠在寺内寻找线索，查明此事。NOR"}},{type="gaintab",args={"10001",21}},{type="showbutton",args={2,0}},{type="showbutton",args={3,1}},{type="refresh",args={}}},caozuoName3="交谈",buttonShow3=0,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={{type="doc",args={"YEL真悟：你们昨天进寺，师傅当晚就毙命在此，这件事一定和你二人有关。昨夜我派人在少侠房外看护，这足以证明大师的死不是少侠干的，还请劳烦少侠在寺内寻找线索，查明此事。NOR"}}},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},role01018={id="role01018",baseId="npc01021",combatid={1,1029},name="扫地沙弥",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="询问",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"YEL扫地沙弥：少侠所问之事小僧并不知晓，不过少侠可以前往钟楼询问其他僧人，钟楼靠近客堂，那里值守的僧人说不定知道些什么。NOR"}},{type="gaintab",args={"10001",22}},{type="gaintab",args={"10012",1}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}},{type="refresh",args={}}},caozuoName2="询问",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"YEL扫地沙弥：少侠所问之事小僧并不知晓，不过少侠可以前往钟楼询问其他僧人，钟楼靠近客堂，那里值守的僧人说不定知道些什么。NOR"}}},caozuoName3="交谈",buttonShow3=0,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={{type="doc",args={"YEL扫地沙弥：昨夜真荣师叔的衣服上好像沾了些红色的蜡油,但为何各殿内都未见蜡油的痕迹。NOR"}}},caozuoName4="询问",buttonShow4=0,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={{type="doc",args={"YEL扫地沙弥：刚才真荣师叔也来过，只不过我一不留神师叔就不知去哪了。少侠你可以去佛像附近看看，刚才真荣师叔一直在那边走动，好像在寻找什么。NOR"}},{type="gaintab",args={"10001",28}},{type="refresh",args={}}},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"10012",3}}}},autoResult1={{type="showbutton",args={2,0}},{type="showbutton",args={3,1}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"10001",27}}}},autoResult2={{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,0}},{type="showbutton",args={3,0}},{type="showbutton",args={4,1}}},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"10001",31}}}},autoResult3={{type="outobject",args={"role01018"}}},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},role01019={id="role01019",baseId="npc01013",combatid={1,1029},name="敲钟僧人",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="叫醒",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"YEL敲钟僧人：少...少侠？现在都这个时辰了？我居然睡了这么久，呃...头好痛...NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}},{type="gaintab",args={"10012",2}},{type="refresh",args={}}},caozuoName2="询问",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={[[YEL敲钟僧人：昨夜真荣师叔很晚才回来，而后真荣师叔给我和鼓楼的弟子送来了吃食，吃完后便有些困意。睡着前我曾看到罗琼施主从客堂内走出，往方丈院方向走去，在之后的事情我就不得而知了。
