罗琼：你若再敢胡言乱语我必一掌打死你！NOR]]}}},caozuoName2="质问",buttonShow2=1,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={[[CYN你将海鲸腰牌拿出并质问韩戚去斋堂的目的，见到腰牌韩戚脸上露出慌张神色。NOR
YEL韩戚：我...我昨晚突然饿了，想去看看有没有吃的。
罗琼：哼，我看杀了大师的人一定是你，少在这狡辩，乖乖坦白说不定还能饶你一命。
韩戚：你闭嘴！轮不到你来说话！昨夜我去斋堂拿了些馒头就走了，不信你可以去问那边的僧人。NOR]]}},{type="gaintab",args={"10017",1}},{type="itemout",args={"tz01002",1}},{type="refresh",args={}}},caozuoName3="交谈",buttonShow3=0,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={{type="doc",args={"YEL韩戚：这家伙竟然有如此厉害的实力？NOR"}}},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"10001",30}},{type="inroom",args={"room0112","room0111"}}}},autoResult1={{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,0}},{type="showbutton",args={3,1}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"10001",27}}}},autoResult2={{type="showbutton",args={2,0}}},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},role01030={id="role01030",baseId="npc01003",combatid={1,1030},name="罗琼",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="交谈",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"YEL罗琼：哼！我看这件事一定是韩戚干的！这混蛋竟然想将罪名嫁祸给我，若不是有人拦着我今天非杀了这个满口胡言乱语的家伙！NOR"}}},caozuoName2="质问",buttonShow2=1,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={[[CYN你将诵经僧人交付的发簪拿给罗琼。NOR
YEL罗琼：这怎么会在你这？快还给我！NOR
CYN见罗琼欲要从你手中抢夺发簪，你便一把拦住他继续质问。NOR
YEL罗琼：好！我都说！昨晚我确实去找过大师，本想让他在今日商讨之时多多照顾，不曾想这老和尚竟然给我讲起了大道理，还说什么愿为弟子受过，我一时气急便打了他一掌。
罗琼：不过以我的功力，那一掌根本不能打死大师，我离开时，老和尚还在悠闲喝茶，他的死真的与我无关。NOR]]}},{type="itemout",args={"tz01003",1}},{type="gaintab",args={"10018",1}},{type="refresh",args={}}},caozuoName3="交谈",buttonShow3=0,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={{type="doc",args={"YEL罗琼：看来之前这家伙一直在隐藏身手，只是我有些奇怪，此人招式怪异，有点像是万灵的功法但其中又掺杂了一些从未见过的招式。NOR"}}},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"10001",30}},{type="inroom",args={"room0112","room0111"}}}},autoResult1={{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,0}},{type="showbutton",args={3,1}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"10001",27}}}},autoResult2={{type="showbutton",args={2,0}}},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},role01031={id="role01031",baseId="npc01004",combatid={1,1029},name="真悟",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="交谈",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"YEL真悟：少侠不知你可找到有用的线索？这二人都说和自己无关，并且都咬定是对方做的。NOR"}}},caozuoName2="给与血衣",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={[[CYN二人分别交代了昨晚的行踪，根据你调到的线索断定这二人说的应该属实，你将古井下找到的血衣与密道之事告知真悟。NOR
